# App folder layout

Under `packages/app/src/`:

| Folder | Put here | Not here |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `domain/` | Business logic, domain types, protocol types (`runner-events`), run grouping/layout | Vue UI, IPC contracts, generic helpers |
| `utils/` | Reusable, domain-agnostic helpers (`cn`, `formatDuration`) | Run/job/step rules, event folding, API calls |
| `components/` | Vue UI (screens + shadcn under `components/ui/`) | Business rules, fetch/IPC orchestration |
| `services/` | API / IPC contracts and call wrappers (`ipc-channels`, `pipebox-api`) | Domain transforms, presentational components |

```text
// ❌ BAD — domain logic in utils
packages/app/src/utils/group-run-events.ts

// ✅ GOOD — domain owns business logic
packages/app/src/domain/run/group-run-events.ts

// ❌ BAD — IPC contract under domain
packages/app/src/domain/shared/ipc-channels.ts

// ✅ GOOD — IPC/API under services; protocol types under domain
packages/app/src/services/ipc-channels.ts
packages/app/src/domain/runner-events.ts
```

Import from `@/domain/...` and `@/services/...`. Domain must not import `services`. Keep `utils` thin.
